{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hant",
  "version": "1.0",
  "strings": {
    "1. 長按桌面空白處 → 左上「編輯」→「加入小工具」": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. Touch and hold the Home Screen → Edit → Add Widget"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. 搜尋「UTUVO Panel」": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Search for “UTUVO Panel”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. 選最高的那個（iOS 27 特大直式），放到空白頁": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. Pick the tallest size (iOS 27 extra-large portrait) and place it on an empty page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4. 面板右上角的齒輪會回到這裡": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4. The gear on the panel brings you back here"
          }
        }
      }
    },
