      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read %lld steps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "定位失敗：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Location failed: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最多五個，照點選順序排列。已選 %lld／5。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Up to five, in the order you tap them. %lld/5 selected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 不讓小工具真的透明（iScreen 也一樣要一張桌布）。選你設成桌布的那張原圖就好，會自動裁成面板那一塊；或滑到空白桌面截圖再選。加進桌面後用「對齊背景」拖到位。\n想完全免圖：設定 › 桌面與 App 資料庫 › 圖示樣式選「透明」，系統會把面板變成玻璃。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS doesn’t let widgets be truly transparent (iScreen needs a wallpaper too). Just pick the photo you use as wallpaper and it’s cropped to the panel automatically, or screenshot an empty Home Screen page. After adding the widget, use Align Background to drag it into place.\nTo skip images entirely: Settings › Home Screen & App Library › Icons › Clear, and the system turns the panel into glass."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "面板尺寸目前是估的；小工具加進桌面後會回報真實尺寸，之後重新裁一次就準了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The panel size is estimated for now; once the widget is on the Home Screen it reports its real size and the next crop is exact."
          }
        }
      }
    },
