    "最多四個，照點選順序排列。已選 %lld／4。數字是每 15 分鐘的快照；iOS 不讓 app 切換 Wi-Fi 或藍牙。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Up to four, in the order you tap them. %lld/4 selected. Values are 15-minute snapshots; iOS doesn’t let apps toggle Wi-Fi or Bluetooth."
          }
        }
      }
    },
