    "深色模式的桌布（選填）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dark Mode wallpaper (optional)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "換深色桌布": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change Dark Mode wallpaper"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "移除深色桌布": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove Dark Mode wallpaper"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 不讓小工具真的透明，iScreen 也是用一張桌布截圖。選你設成桌布的那張原圖，或滑到空白桌面截圖再選，會自動裁成面板那一塊。\n位置可以在這裡「對齊背景」拖，或長按小工具 › 編輯小工具 › 位置 直接選。\n深色模式下 iOS 會把桌布調暗：想完全對上，切到深色模式再截一次空白頁，放進「深色模式的桌布」。\n對不齊？到 設定 › 桌布 › 主畫面預覽 關掉「透視縮放」，設定 › 螢幕顯示與亮度 › 顯示縮放 選「預設」，再重新截圖。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS doesn’t let widgets be truly transparent — iScreen uses a wallpaper screenshot too. Pick the photo you use as wallpaper, or a screenshot of an empty Home Screen page, and it’s cropped to the panel automatically.\nSet the position here with Align Background, or long-press the widget › Edit Widget › Position.\nIn Dark Mode iOS dims the wallpaper: for an exact match, switch to Dark Mode, screenshot an empty page again and add it under Dark Mode wallpaper.\nNot lining up? In Settings › Wallpaper › Home Screen preview turn off Perspective Zoom, set Settings › Display & Brightness › Display Zoom to Default, then take the screenshot again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "三步驟設定": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Three-step setup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "三步都做完後這裡會自動收起來，要再看到設定底下「透明背景」裡的連結。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When all three are done, this section collapses on its own. To see it again later, tap “Show setup steps again” under Transparent Background."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把面板加到桌面": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add the panel to your Home Screen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "長按桌面空白處 › 左上「編輯」› 加入小工具 › 搜尋 UTUVO Panel › 選最高的尺寸": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touch and hold an empty spot › Edit › Add Widget › search UTUVO Panel › pick the tallest size"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "截一張空白桌面，交給 app": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Screenshot an empty Home Screen page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "長按桌面讓圖示抖動 › 往左滑到最後的空白頁 › 側邊按鈕＋音量上截圖。桌布是自己的照片就直接選那張": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touch and hold until the icons jiggle › swipe to the empty page at the end › press the side button and volume up. If your wallpaper is your own photo, just pick that photo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "告訴面板它在哪裡": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tell the panel where it sits"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "長按面板 › 編輯小工具 › 背景選「透明」；面板在最上面就選「頁面頂端」，上面有一排 app 就選「往下一列」": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touch and hold the panel › Edit Widget › Background: Transparent. Position: Top of the page if nothing is above it, One row down if a row of apps is above it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "選你的桌布（截圖或照片）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose your wallpaper (screenshot or photo)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "或在 app 裡拖著對齊": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Or drag it into place in the app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你選了漸層背景，不需要桌布": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You chose the gradient background — no wallpaper needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重新看設定步驟": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show setup steps again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "桌布會輪播、或不想截圖？長按桌面 › 左上「編輯」› 自訂 › 選「清透」。面板會變成真的透明玻璃，桌布換成什麼都跟著變，不用做第 2、3 步（文字會變白色，app 圖示保留原色）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wallpaper on shuffle, or don't want a screenshot? Touch and hold the Home Screen › Edit › Customize › Clear. The panel becomes real glass that follows whatever wallpaper is showing — skip steps 2 and 3 (text turns white; app icons keep their colours)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
